CampaignVault.Lewd — Adult Content Notice
=========================================

This repository contains optional adult / sexual content for CampaignVault
(the `lewd_encounter` interaction mode and related data/skills).

1. Operator opt-in only
   Install this plugin only if every player at your table consents to adult
   content. Enable the mode per campaign via EnabledModeIds; uninstall by
   deleting the plugin folder and removing the mode id from campaigns.

2. Full-trust DLL
   Like any CampaignVault code plugin, LewdHandbook.dll runs in-process with
   the same trust as first-party host code. Load only from authors you trust.
   This separate repository isolates content and opt-in install; it does not
   sandbox the plugin.

3. Do not ship CampaignVault.PluginSdk.dll
   The plugin PackageReferences CampaignVault.PluginSdk for compile-time
   contracts. The host supplies the Sdk assembly. Never place
   CampaignVault.PluginSdk.dll next to LewdHandbook.dll.

